window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>In this chilling adventure, Vampire Hunter D has been dispatched to vanquish the ancient vampiric Noble Count Braujou, guardian of an ancient buried treasure. But when a mysterious object crashes into the earth, destroying half of the northern Frontier, D faces an even more terrifying opponent—the renegade vampire Valcua, the Ultimate Noble! <br> <br> Having been exiled to outer space, Valcua took his entire kingdom of strange and deadly creatures with him, and swore that when the time was right they would return to have their revenge. <br> <br> Unfortunately for D, that time is now...<br> <br> Adapted from the novel and produced with a full cast of actors, immersive sound effects and cinematic music!<br> <br> Performed by Scott McCormick, David Cui Cui, Terence Aselford, Alex Hill-Knight, Christopher Williams, Rayner Gabriel, Shanta Parasuraman, Yasmin Tuazon, Chris Walker, Colleen Delaney, Danny Gavigan, Damon Alums, Debi Tinsley, Donald Guzzi, Drew Kopas, Eric Messner, James Konicek, Jeri Marshall, Nora Achrati, RJ Bayley, Ryan Carlo Dalusung, and Wyn Delano.</p>"; 
